  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>:</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8477;</mi></math>&nbsp;be a continuous function such that&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>t</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Then which of the following statements is (are) TRUE?</p>"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "The equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>cos</mi><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;has at least one solution in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "The equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>sin</mi><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>6</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mfrac></math>&nbsp;has at least one solution in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>t</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": true
