  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>(A) Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>cos</mi><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>Now</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac></msubsup><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac></msubsup><mi>cos</mi><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>-</mo><msubsup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>0</mn><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Hence <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;has a root in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>(B) Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>h</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>sin</mi><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>6</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mfrac></math></p><p>Now</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac></msubsup><mi>h</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac></msubsup><mi>sin</mi><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac></msubsup><mfrac><mn>6</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>-</mo><msubsup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>cos</mi><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>0</mn><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow><mi>&#960;</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mn>0</mn><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac></msubsup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Hence <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>h</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>has a root in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>(C) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>)</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msup></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfenced><mrow><munder><munder><mrow><mfenced><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msup></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo></mrow><mo>&#9183;</mo></munder><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></munder><munder><munder><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">)</mo></mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mo>&#9183;</mo></munder><mrow><mi>Apply</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mi>hospital</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>rule</mi></mrow></munder></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow><mn>1</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>(D)&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>t</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfenced><mrow><munder><munder><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mo>&#9183;</mo></munder><mn>1</mn></munder><mo>&#215;</mo><munder><munder><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">)</mo></mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mo>&#9183;</mo></munder><mrow><mi>Apply</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mi>hospital</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>rule</mi></mrow></munder></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow><mn>1</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>&nbsp;</p>"
  }
}